{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/presidio-anonymizer","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:18:44.663Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/presidio-anonymizer/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/presidio-anonymizer/presidio-anonymizer/about"},"readme":"## About\n\nPresidio is a context aware, pluggable and customizable data protection and PII data anonymization\nservice for text and images.\n\nThe Presidio anonymizer is a Python based module for anonymizing detected PII text entities with desired values.\n\n+ [GitHub Repo](https://github.com/data-privacy-stack/presidio)\n+ [Documentation](https://microsoft.github.io/presidio/anonymizer/index.html)\n\n## Project transition and container registry update\n\nThe Presidio project is transitioning from a Microsoft-owned project to an\nindependent, community-governed open source project under the Data Privacy Stack\nGitHub organization. Its new repository is\n[github.com/data-privacy-stack/presidio](https://github.com/data-privacy-stack/presidio).\n\nNew Presidio Anonymizer container releases are published to GitHub Container\nRegistry at\n[`ghcr.io/data-privacy-stack/presidio-anonymizer`](https://github.com/orgs/data-privacy-stack/packages/container/package/presidio-anonymizer).\nThis MCR repository remains available as a legacy location, but\n`mcr.microsoft.com/presidio-anonymizer:latest` no longer represents the newest\nPresidio release. For quick tests, use\n`ghcr.io/data-privacy-stack/presidio-anonymizer:latest`; for production, pin an\nexplicit GHCR release tag.\n\n## Featured tags\n\n+ `latest` - Legacy MCR tag. No longer updated with the latest Presidio version; use `ghcr.io/data-privacy-stack/presidio-anonymizer:latest` or a pinned GHCR release tag instead.\n\n## Related repositories\n\n+ [Presidio Analyzer](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-presidio-analyzer)\n+ [Presidio Image Redactor](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-presidio-image-redactor)\n\n## Support\n\n- Before you submit an issue, please go over the [documentation](https://microsoft.github.io/presidio).\n  For general discussions, please use the [Github repo's discussion board](https://github.com/microsoft/presidio/discussions).\n- If you have a usage question, found a bug or have a suggestion for improvement, please file a [Github issue](https://github.com/microsoft/presidio/issues).\n- For other matters, please email [presidio@microsoft.com](mailto:presidio@microsoft.com).\n\n## License\n- Legal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice)\n\nThe project is covered by MIT License. The detailed license text is available [here](https://github.com/Microsoft/presidio/blob/main/LICENSE)\n\nWarning: ***Presidio can help identify sensitive/PII data in un/structured text. However, because Presidio is using trained ML models, there is no guarantee that Presidio will find all sensitive information. Consequently, additional systems and protections should be employed.***","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-07-13T12:54:53.6552836+00:00","categories":[],"keywords":[],"license":"MIT","links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"pullsText":"348K+","stars":null},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"latest","digest":"sha256:a10a12a2a613d13cf29d3ad3641e3258444dd8c90403dd644a0a114c472c2483","pushed":"2026-03-15T12:45:51.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":null},{"name":"2.2.362","digest":"sha256:a10a12a2a613d13cf29d3ad3641e3258444dd8c90403dd644a0a114c472c2483","pushed":"2026-03-15T12:44:53.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":null},{"name":"2.2.361","digest":"sha256:022fc4bb42cd43b0c27526b6a0394b2b14aaf4b972a